---
import SiteSymbol from '../../components/SiteSymbol.astro';
import MarkedList from '../../components/MarkedList.astro';
import { fundraisingModuleSymbols, starterReviewSymbols, starterStepSymbols, starterSymbols } from '../../lib/list-identities';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Crumbs from '../../components/Crumbs.astro';
import ReviewNote from '../../components/ReviewNote.astro';
import CharityStartPlanner from '../../components/CharityStartPlanner.astro';
import {charityStartJobs, CHARITY_START_VERSION} from '../../data/charity-start.mjs';
import {url} from '../../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Start with one job" description="Six practical starting checklists for charity teams, with a page-only first-week planner, reviewed Markdown download and links to existing Charitology guides and Charity OS.">
  <header class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><Crumbs items={[{label:'For charities',href:'/for-charities/'},{label:'Start with one job'}]} /><p class="eyebrow">For the people doing the work · practice draft {CHARITY_START_VERSION}</p><h1>One job.<br />A clearer next step.</h1><p class="lede">Keep a donor promise, count costs or untangle a handover. Choose one practical job, inspect the proposed checklist and decide what your team wants to try.</p><div class="start-actions"><a class="btn" href="#planner">Prepare a first-week plan</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#checklists">Read all six checklists</a></div></div></header>
  <div class="wrap start-body">
    <section class="prose"><h2>Start from the work you already do.</h2><p>Follow the signals and channels around a task, the work they support, and the outcomes and feedback that could change a decision. A small practical job can reveal a larger coordination question. Relief, repair, prevention, structure and source describe mechanisms, not moral grades; every level may be needed.</p><p>These first-week sequences are untested editorial proposals, labeled as hypotheses. A completed checklist does not prove savings, fundraising success or charitable impact. Keep what works, question the assumptions and adapt the sequence to your team’s authority and capacity.</p></section>
    <nav class="start-jobs" aria-label="Six jobs to start with">{charityStartJobs.map(job=><a class="identity-link" href={`#${job.id}`}>{job.title}</a>)}</nav>
    <CharityStartPlanner />
    <section id="checklists" aria-labelledby="checklists-title"><p class="eyebrow">Readable with or without JavaScript</p><h2 id="checklists-title">Six proposed first-week checklists.</h2><div class="start-checklists">{charityStartJobs.map(job=><article class="start-job" id={job.id}><p class="eyebrow">Editorial draft · hypothesis</p><h3><SiteSymbol name={starterSymbols[job.id]} /> {job.title}</h3><p class="start-question">{job.question}</p><MarkedList ordered items={job.steps.map((step, index) => [step, starterStepSymbols[job.id][index]] as const)} /><p><strong>Proposed output:</strong> {job.output}</p><details><summary>Questions for the next review</summary><MarkedList items={job.questions.map((question, index) => [question, starterReviewSymbols[job.id][index]] as const)} /></details><h4>Read and use</h4><ul class="start-links">{job.links.map(link=><li><a href={url(link.path)}>{link.label} →</a></li>)}</ul><p><strong>Optional manual shared workspace:</strong> {job.os.map((module,index)=><>{index>0?' · ':''}<a class="identity-link" data-source-symbol={fundraisingModuleSymbols[module.id]} href={`https://os.charitology.org/#module/${module.id}`}>{module.label}</a></>)}</p><p class="start-limit">{job.limit}</p></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="prose start-next"><h2>Bring the question back to the team.</h2><p>Opening an OS module requires sign-in and organization choice. These links transfer no plan, create no record and send no message. You can use the checklist entirely on paper or in your own system.</p><p>For a private discussion, describe one process in general terms at <a href="mailto:hello@charitology.org?subject=Charitology%20one-job%20question">hello@charitology.org</a>. Begin without attachments, personal records or confidential figures. A conversation does not establish a service commitment or partnership.</p><p><a href={url('/for-charities/collaborate/')}>Help shape the resources</a> · <a href={url('/for-charities/')}>Browse everything for charities</a> · <a href={url('/method/')}>Read the Method</a></p></section>
    <ReviewNote filePath="src/data/charity-start.mjs" title="Start with one charity job" />
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .start-body{padding-bottom:3rem}.start-actions{display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1.5rem}.start-jobs{display:flex;gap:.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:1.5rem 0 2rem}.start-jobs a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:2.8rem;padding:.5rem .8rem;border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:var(--radius);font:500 .85rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none}.start-jobs a:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}.start-checklists{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0 3rem}.start-job{border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:1.5rem;border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--surface);min-width:0;scroll-margin-top:5rem}.start-job h3{font-size:1.65rem;margin:.4rem 0 1rem}.start-question{font-weight:600}.start-job li{margin-bottom:.65rem}.start-job h4{margin-bottom:.5rem}.start-links{padding-left:1.2rem}.start-limit{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-2);border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:1rem}.start-next{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:2rem}a{overflow-wrap:anywhere}#checklists{scroll-margin-top:5rem}@media(max-width:700px){.start-checklists{grid-template-columns:1fr}.start-job{padding:1.15rem}}@media print{.start-actions,.start-jobs{display:none}.start-checklists{display:block}.start-job{break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:1rem}}
</style>
